CareerCraft — build and testing playground roadmap
=================================================

Purpose
-------

CareerCraft remains a truthful, ATS-safe QA/Test Engineer resume builder and
job-tracking workspace. The same product is also becoming a safe learning lab
where you can practise testing a real Flask, JavaScript, SQLite application.
Every page below must either save data, expose a documented test surface, or
teach a test technique against a working feature. We will not add fake pages
just to increase page count.

